---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const chapters = [
  { n: '1', title: '操作系统简介', sub: '建立整体认识', text: '操作系统的作用与功能、发展与分类、体系结构，以及 CPU 指令执行。', tags: '识记 · 领会' },
  { n: '2', title: '进程管理', sub: '理解并发与协调', text: '从进程状态和内核机制，到线程、同步互斥、信号量与进程通信。', tags: '识记 · 领会 · 综合应用' },
  { n: '3', title: '进程调度与死锁', sub: '掌握算法与计算', text: '比较调度策略，计算周转时间，判断安全状态并推演银行家算法。', tags: '识记 · 领会 · 简单应用' },
];
---
<div class="home-intro">
  <div class="intro-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="edition-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>2017 年版教材 · 自学考试大纲</p>
    <p class="intro-description">按大纲梳理知识点，结合教材习题复习。<br class="desktop-break" />从操作系统的基本概念，到进程同步、调度与死锁。</p>
    <div class="home-actions"><a class="primary-link" data-next-chapter href={`${base}/chapters/chapter-1/`}><span data-next-label>开始第一章</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6" /></svg></a><span class="intro-meta">3 章笔记 · 15 幅插图</span></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="progress-panel" aria-label="复习进度">
    <div class="progress-heading"><span>复习进度</span><span class="local-label">本地记录</span></div>
    <p class="progress-total"><strong data-progress-count>0</strong><span>/ 3 章</span></p>
    <progress data-study-progress value="0" max="3" aria-label="已复习章节"></progress>
    <p>在章节页勾选“本章已复习”即可记录。</p>
  </aside>
</div>
<section class="chapter-section" aria-labelledby="chapter-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="chapter-heading">章节目录</h2><span>教材顺序</span></div>
  <div class="chapter-grid">
    {chapters.map(chapter => <a class="chapter-card" href={`${base}/chapters/chapter-${chapter.n}/`}>
      <span class="chapter-number" aria-hidden="true">0{chapter.n}</span>
      <div class="chapter-copy"><div class="chapter-title-row"><h3>{chapter.title}</h3><span class="progress-badge" data-progress-chapter={chapter.n}>待复习</span></div><p>{chapter.text}</p><div class="chapter-tags">{chapter.tags.split(' · ').map(tag => <span>{tag}</span>)}</div></div>
      <svg class="row-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" /></svg>
    </a>)}
  </div>
</section>
<a class="lab-entry" href={`${base}/lab/scheduling/`}><div class="lab-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M5 8h9v5H5zm9 6h12v5H14zM8 20h11v5H8zM4 28h24" /></svg></div><div><span class="eyebrow">交互练习</span><h2>进程调度实验</h2><p>修改参数，对照时间轴比较 FCFS、SPF 与时间片轮转。</p></div><svg class="row-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6" /></svg></a>
<div class="reading-notes"><p><strong>按需查阅</strong><span>顶部搜索可直达概念与习题；题目答案支持折叠，插图支持放大。</span></p><p><strong>记录说明</strong><span>复习进度与字号保存在当前浏览器，不跨设备同步。</span></p></div>
